# Premium UI Phases (CSS-only vertical slices)

**Palette:** dark premium navy primary + rich sky-blue secondary. **Neutrals:** gray-white surfaces unchanged.  
**Arkitect tags:** `design-tokens`, `ui-redesign`, `vertical-slice-delivery`, `strangler-fig`  
**Rule:** CSS-only per phase — no JS/state refactors unless a separate feature ticket.

## Paved route (UI work)

1. Run Arkitect paved route ([arkitect-mcp-paved-route.mdc](arkitect-mcp-paved-route.mdc)) with UI tags above.
2. One tab/surface per phase; link new sheet in `popup.html` after `tokens.css` + `primitives.css`.
3. Tokenize matching inline rules in `popup.html` so cascade stays correct.
4. Bump `palette-preview.html` phase label.

## Phase map

| Phase | Asset | Scope |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | `tokens.css` | Design tokens (`--pc-*`) |
| 1 | `primitives.css` | Shared buttons, inputs, chips |
| 2–4 | inline → extract | Header, tabs, auth banner |
| 5 | `clips.css` | `#clipsTab` |
| 6 | `search.css` | `#searchTab` |
| 7 | `categories.css` | `#categoriesTab`, files carousel, category picker |
| 8 | `ai-lab.css` | `#aiTab`, summary/breakdown/refactor, credits, gallery |
| 9+ | next sheet | modals, settings, content widget, website |

## File order in popup.html

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/styles/tokens.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/styles/primitives.css">
<!-- phase sheets: clips.css, categories.css, ai-lab.css, search.css, … -->
<style> /* inline critical + not yet extracted */ </style>
```

## Forbidden in UI phases

- New hardcoded purple/green brand hex — use `--pc-*` tokens.
- Renaming storage keys or message types during CSS-only phases.
- Expanding `popup.html` inline CSS for a tab already extracted to its phase sheet.

## Verify each phase

Reload at `chrome://extensions` → spot-check target tab → ask Ezequiel SUCCESS before SuccessLog.
